  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Capabilities to Protect Vulnerable Communities in North Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to help target and disrupt criminal networks for migrant smuggling, human trafficking, child exploitation and related crimes in Morocco, Algeria, Tunisia and Egypt, as well as associated routes and countries, allowing for the identification and rescue of victims, increased prosecution of perpetrators and prevention of further crimes.</narrative>
  </description>
